20, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628121.9608746, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 19, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4439235}, "bruno/digitorn-api/04 - Credentials/List providers.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: List providers\n  type: http\n  seq: 1\n}\n\nget {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/credentials/providers\n  body: none\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\ndocs {\n  All credential provider blueprints the daemon can store (api_key + oauth2): deepseek, openai, anthropic, google, github, slack, notion... Each entry lists required fields.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 364, "lines": 20, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628121.962885, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 19, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4439235}, "bruno/digitorn-api/04 - Credentials/My credentials.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: My credentials\n  type: http\n  seq: 2\n}\n\nget {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/users/me/credentials\n  body: none\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\ndocs {\n  All credentials stored by the authenticated user (per-user and per-app-per-user). Values are masked — only previews + metadata.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 319, "lines": 20, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628121.9686353, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 19, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4439235}, "bruno/digitorn-api/04 - Credentials/Set DeepSeek API key.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: Set DeepSeek API key\n  type: http\n  seq: 3\n}\n\nput {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/users/me/credentials/_global/deepseek\n  body: json\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\nbody:json {\n  {\n    \"fields\": {\n      \"api_key\": \"sk-your-deepseek-api-key\"\n    },\n    \"scope\": \"per_user\"\n  }\n}\n\ndocs {\n  Stores a credential globally for the user (`_global` app_id = applies to every app the user runs). Use `per_app_per_user` scope + a real app_id to scope the key to one app instead.\n\n  The `fields` dict is encrypted at rest with the daemon's master.key.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 581, "lines": 31, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628121.972226, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 30, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4439235}, "bruno/digitorn-api/05 - Apps/Deploy status.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: Deploy status\n  type: http\n  seq: 4\n}\n\nget {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/{{test_app_id}}/deploy-status\n  body: none\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\ndocs {\n  Poll this after POST /deploy. Returns `ready|deploying|failed` with error details when it fails. Helpful to know when an app is truly online before sending messages.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 370, "lines": 20, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628121.977101, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 19, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4439235}, "bruno/digitorn-api/05 - Apps/Deploy.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: Deploy\n  type: http\n  seq: 3\n}\n\npost {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/deploy\n  body: json\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\nbody:json {\n  {\n    \"yaml_path\": \"C:/Users/ASUS/Documents/digitorn-bridge/knowledge_base/tutorials/01-hello-world.yaml\",\n    \"force\": false\n  }\n}\n\nscript:post-response {\n  if (res.status === 200 && res.body?.data?.app_id) {\n    bru.setEnvVar(\"test_app_id\", res.body.data.app_id);\n  }\n}\n\ndocs {\n  Deploys an app from a YAML file on disk. Runs async — response returns `status: deploying` immediately; poll `GET /api/apps/{app_id}` to check when it's fully online.\n\n  Alternative: POST /api/apps/deploy/upload to deploy from an uploaded YAML string in the body (no file required).\n\n  Optional fields: `force: true` (ignore hash, force redeploy), `secrets: {KEY: value}` (inject secrets at deploy time).\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 867, "lines": 37, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628121.9818845, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 36, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4439235}, "bruno/digitorn-api/05 - Apps/folder.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: 05 - Apps\n  seq: 7\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 36, "lines": 5, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628121.9853778, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 4, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4570096}, "bruno/digitorn-api/05 - Apps/Get app.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: Get app\n  type: http\n  seq: 5\n}\n\nget {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/{{test_app_id}}\n  body: none\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\ndocs {\n  Full summary of a deployed app: app_id, agents, modules, total_tools, deployed_at, mode, greeting. Returns 404 if not deployed, 503 with `Retry-After: 2` if daemon is still warming up.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 369, "lines": 20, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628121.9853778, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 19, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4439235}, "bruno/digitorn-api/05 - Apps/List deployed.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: List deployed\n  type: http\n  seq: 1\n}\n\nget {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps\n  body: none\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\ndocs {\n  All apps visible to the caller (user-scoped + system-scoped). Admins can pass `?include_disabled=true` to also see disabled apps.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 304, "lines": 20, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628121.9967148, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 19, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4439235}, "bruno/digitorn-api/05 - Apps/UI config.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: UI config\n  type: http\n  seq: 6\n}\n\nget {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/{{test_app_id}}/ui-config\n  body: none\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\ndocs {\n  Safe allow-listed subset for the client UI: render_mode, auto_approve, sync_to_disk, preview.enabled. Added to replace the insecure ?include_yaml=true approach that leaked system prompts + api keys.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 395, "lines": 20, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628121.9967148, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 19, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4439235}, "bruno/digitorn-api/05 - Apps/Validate YAML.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: Validate YAML\n  type: http\n  seq: 2\n}\n\npost {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/validate\n  body: json\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\nbody:json {\n  {\n    \"yaml_path\": \"C:/Users/ASUS/Documents/digitorn-bridge/knowledge_base/tutorials/01-hello-world.yaml\"\n  }\n}\n\ndocs {\n  Validate an app YAML on disk without deploying. Returns metadata + errors, nothing persisted. Same code path as deploy but without the bootstrap.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 457, "lines": 26, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.005735, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 25, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4570096}, "bruno/digitorn-api/06 - Sessions/Abort turn.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: Abort turn\n  type: http\n  seq: 5\n}\n\npost {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/{{test_app_id}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/abort\n  body: json\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\nbody:json {\n  {}\n}\n\ndocs {\n  Kills the in-flight turn: cancels the agent's asyncio task, stops any running sub-agents, emits `agent_cancel` events, and injects synthetic `\"interrupted\": true` tool results on resume. Safe to call even when no turn is running.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 468, "lines": 24, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.005735, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 23, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4570096}, "bruno/digitorn-api/06 - Sessions/Compact context.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: Compact context\n  type: http\n  seq: 6\n}\n\npost {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/{{test_app_id}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/compact\n  body: json\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\nbody:json {\n  {}\n}\n\ndocs {\n  Manually trigger context compaction — summarizes older turns to free tokens. Usually automatic when context_pressure hook fires.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 374, "lines": 24, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.012817, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 23, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4570096}, "bruno/digitorn-api/06 - Sessions/Create session.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: Create session\n  type: http\n  seq: 1\n}\n\npost {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/{{test_app_id}}/sessions\n  body: json\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\nbody:json {\n  {}\n}\n\nscript:post-response {\n  if (res.status === 200 && res.body?.data?.session_id) {\n    bru.setEnvVar(\"session_id\", res.body.data.session_id);\n  }\n}\n\ndocs {\n  Creates a new conversation session. Body is optional — pass `{\"workspace_path\": \"/abs/path\"}` to bind the session to a filesystem directory (state persists under `{workspace_path}/.digitorn/sessions/{session_id}/`).\n\n  Response captures `session_id` into the env var for every subsequent session-scoped call.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 677, "lines": 32, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.0177515, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 31, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4570096}, "bruno/digitorn-api/06 - Sessions/Delete session.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: Delete session\n  type: http\n  seq: 7\n}\n\ndelete {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/{{test_app_id}}/sessions/{{session_id}}\n  body: none\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 206, "lines": 16, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.019064, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 15, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4570096}, "bruno/digitorn-api/06 - Sessions/folder.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: 06 - Sessions\n  seq: 8\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 40, "lines": 5, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.0257657, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 4, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4694154}, "bruno/digitorn-api/06 - Sessions/Get session.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: Get session\n  type: http\n  seq: 3\n}\n\nget {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/{{test_app_id}}/sessions/{{session_id}}\n  body: none\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\ndocs {\n  Full session state: messages[], busy flag, workspace info, agent metrics. Poll this after sending a message to check when the agent finishes (`busy: false`).\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 370, "lines": 20, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.0285246, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 19, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4570096}, "bruno/digitorn-api/06 - Sessions/List sessions.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: List sessions\n  type: http\n  seq: 2\n}\n\nget {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/{{test_app_id}}/sessions\n  body: none\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 187, "lines": 16, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.0350327, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 15, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4665575}, "bruno/digitorn-api/06 - Sessions/Session history.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: Session history\n  type: http\n  seq: 4\n}\n\nget {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/{{test_app_id}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/history\n  body: none\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\ndocs {\n  Message history only — lighter than /sessions/{sid} when you just need the transcript. Supports `?limit=N&before=TURN_ID` for paging.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 358, "lines": 20, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.0350327, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 19, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4683385}, "bruno/digitorn-api/07 - Messages/folder.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: 07 - Messages\n  seq: 9\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 40, "lines": 5, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.0442855, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 4, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4709861}, "bruno/digitorn-api/07 - Messages/Queue status.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: Queue status\n  type: http\n  seq: 3\n}\n\nget {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/{{test_app_id}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/queue\n  body: none\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\ndocs {\n  Current state of the per-session message queue: pending count, in-flight correlation_id, history of recent turns.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 333, "lines": 20, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.0477083, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 19, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4709861}, "bruno/digitorn-api/07 - Messages/Send message.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: Send message\n  type: http\n  seq: 1\n}\n\npost {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/{{test_app_id}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/messages\n  body: json\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\nbody:json {\n  {\n    \"message\": \"Hi there, just testing the API from Bruno.\",\n    \"queue_mode\": \"async\",\n    \"client_message_id\": \"bruno-msg-1\"\n  }\n}\n\ndocs {\n  Queues a user message for the session. Returns 202 + correlation_id immediately (`queue_mode: \"async\"` default). Listen on Socket.IO `session:{{session_id}}` room for the streamed response, or poll GET /sessions/{sid} until `busy: false`.\n\n  Use `queue_mode: \"wait\"` to block until the turn completes (legacy; prefer async + Socket.IO). Max message: 1 MiB.\n\n  The optional `client_message_id` is echoed back so you can match optimistic UI bubbles to the authoritative server echo.\n\n  **Do NOT** send `audio` / `audios` / `audio_refs` — they are rejected with 422. POST the blob to /api/transcribe first and embed the returned text in `message`.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 1018, "lines": 34, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.0520191, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 33, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4709861}, "bruno/digitorn-api/07 - Messages/Send with image.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: Send with image\n  type: http\n  seq: 2\n}\n\npost {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/{{test_app_id}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/messages\n  body: json\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\nbody:json {\n  {\n    \"message\": \"What do you see in this screenshot?\",\n    \"images\": [\n      {\n        \"data\": \"iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAQAAAC1HAwCAAAAC0lEQVR42mNkYAAAAAYAAjCB0C8AAAAASUVORK5CYII=\",\n        \"mime\": \"image/png\",\n        \"name\": \"tiny-red-dot.png\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n\ndocs {\n  Same endpoint, with `images: [{data, mime, name}]` for multimodal apps. Images are stored in the per-session ImageStore and passed to vision-capable providers (Claude, GPT-4o) in native format.\n\n  Non-vision providers (DeepSeek-chat) auto-degrade images to `[Image: description]` text.\n\n  Sample payload here is a 1×1 red PNG (valid base64) — replace with your own.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 883, "lines": 37, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.056759, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 36, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4709861}, "bruno/digitorn-api/08 - Workspace/0 — Deploy workspace demo.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: 0 — Deploy workspace demo\n  type: http\n  seq: 0\n}\n\npost {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/deploy\n  body: json\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\nbody:json {\n  {\n    \"yaml_path\": \"C:/Users/ASUS/Documents/digitorn-bridge/knowledge_base/tutorials/02-workspace-demo.yaml\",\n    \"force\": true\n  }\n}\n\ndocs {\n  Workspace routes (write/approve/reject/commit) require an app that declares the `workspace` module. The default `tutorial-hello-world` does not, so every workspace call was returning 400. Deploy this tiny YAML once and the rest of the folder works.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 592, "lines": 27, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.0603073, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 26, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4709861}, "bruno/digitorn-api/08 - Workspace/0b — Create workspace session.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: 0b — Create workspace session\n  type: http\n  seq: 1\n}\n\npost {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/{{workspace_app_id}}/sessions\n  body: json\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\nbody:json {\n  {}\n}\n\nscript:post-response {\n  if (res.status === 200 && res.body?.data?.session_id) {\n    bru.setEnvVar(\"workspace_session_id\", res.body.data.session_id);\n  }\n}\n\ndocs {\n  Creates a fresh session bound to the workspace-demo app and captures its id into `workspace_session_id`. Every subsequent workspace request here uses that variable.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 563, "lines": 30, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.069262, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 29, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4764962}, "bruno/digitorn-api/08 - Workspace/Approve file.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: Approve file\n  type: http\n  seq: 5\n}\n\npost {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/{{workspace_app_id}}/sessions/{{workspace_session_id}}/workspace/files/approve\n  body: json\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\nbody:json {\n  {\n    \"path\": \"notes.md\"\n  }\n}\n\ndocs {\n  Snapshot the file's current content as the new baseline. Future edits will show pending diffs against this snapshot. Resets `insertions_pending` / `deletions_pending` to 0.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 472, "lines": 26, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.069262, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 25, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4764962}, "bruno/digitorn-api/08 - Workspace/Approve hunks.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: Approve hunks\n  type: http\n  seq: 7\n}\n\npost {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/{{workspace_app_id}}/sessions/{{workspace_session_id}}/workspace/files/approve-hunks\n  body: json\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\nbody:json {\n  {\n    \"path\": \"notes.md\",\n    \"hunks\": [0]\n  }\n}\n\ndocs {\n  Partial approve — stage only the specified hunks. `hunks` accepts either integer indices (0-based) or 12-char SHA-256 identifiers (stable across concurrent writes). Hunks are applied in reverse position order so earlier indices aren't perturbed.\n\n  To have hunks to approve, make a change to notes.md first (via the agent or a \"Writeback file\" call with new content) while a baseline is approved.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 721, "lines": 29, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.075899, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 28, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4764962}, "bruno/digitorn-api/08 - Workspace/Commit session.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: Commit session\n  type: http\n  seq: 8\n}\n\npost {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/{{workspace_app_id}}/sessions/{{workspace_session_id}}/workspace/commit\n  body: json\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\nbody:json {\n  {\n    \"message\": \"Session work — written via Bruno\",\n    \"files\": null,\n    \"push\": false\n  }\n}\n\ndocs {\n  `git add` + `git commit` over the session's approved files. `files: null` commits every approved file; pass an explicit list to commit only a subset. Set `push: true` to also `git push`.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 546, "lines": 28, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.075899, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 27, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4797826}, "bruno/digitorn-api/08 - Workspace/File history.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: File history\n  type: http\n  seq: 8\n}\n\nget {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/{{workspace_app_id}}/sessions/{{workspace_session_id}}/workspace/files/notes.md/history\n  body: none\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\ndocs {\n  Every approved revision of a file: revision number, approved_at, approved_by, tokens_delta (ins/del). Revisions persist under `{ws}/.digitorn/sessions/{sid}/baselines/{path}.history/`.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 446, "lines": 20, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.0853305, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 19, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4797826}, "bruno/digitorn-api/08 - Workspace/folder.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: 08 - Workspace\n  seq: 10\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 42, "lines": 5, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.0853305, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 4, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4862616}, "bruno/digitorn-api/08 - Workspace/List files.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: List files\n  type: http\n  seq: 2\n}\n\nget {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/{{workspace_app_id}}/sessions/{{workspace_session_id}}/workspace\n  body: none\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\ndocs {\n  All files currently in the session's workspace (virtual FS + sync_to_disk mirrored files). Each entry has pending/approved status, git status, baseline line count, and cumulative insert/delete totals.\n\n  Run \"0 — Deploy workspace demo\" then \"0b — Create workspace session\" before this.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 522, "lines": 22, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.094818, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 21, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4797826}, "bruno/digitorn-api/08 - Workspace/Read file.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: Read file\n  type: http\n  seq: 4\n}\n\nget {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/{{workspace_app_id}}/sessions/{{workspace_session_id}}/workspace/files/notes.md?include_baseline=true\n  body: none\n  auth: bearer\n  query: true\n}\n\nparams:query {\n  include_baseline: true\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\ndocs {\n  Content of a workspace file (path is URL-encoded after `/files/`). Add `?include_baseline=true` to get the last-approved version + `unified_diff_pending` (parseable by difflib.PatchSet).\n\n  Run \"Writeback file\" first so notes.md exists.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 566, "lines": 27, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.0972407, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 26, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4797826}, "bruno/digitorn-api/08 - Workspace/Reject file.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: Reject file\n  type: http\n  seq: 6\n}\n\npost {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/{{workspace_app_id}}/sessions/{{workspace_session_id}}/workspace/files/reject\n  body: json\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\nbody:json {\n  {\n    \"path\": \"notes.md\"\n  }\n}\n\ndocs {\n  Revert the file to its last approved baseline. If there's no baseline (file was never approved), the file is deleted.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 415, "lines": 26, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.1018152, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 25, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.48425}, "bruno/digitorn-api/08 - Workspace/Writeback file.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: Writeback file\n  type: http\n  seq: 3\n}\n\nput {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/{{workspace_app_id}}/sessions/{{workspace_session_id}}/workspace/files/notes.md\n  body: json\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\nbody:json {\n  {\n    \"content\": \"# Bruno test\\n\\nThis file was written via the REST API.\\n\",\n    \"auto_approve\": false,\n    \"source\": \"user\"\n  }\n}\n\ndocs {\n  User-side write (manual edit, conflict resolution, drag-drop import). Goes through the same validation pipeline as agent writes, with `source: \"user\"` attribution. Set `auto_approve: true` to snapshot as baseline immediately (bypass pending review).\n\n  Run this BEFORE \"Read file\" / \"Approve file\" / \"File history\" — it creates notes.md in the session workspace.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 765, "lines": 30, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.1018152, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 29, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.48425}, "bruno/digitorn-api/09 - Approvals/folder.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: 09 - Approvals\n  seq: 11\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 42, "lines": 5, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.1018152, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 4, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4862616}, "bruno/digitorn-api/09 - Approvals/List pending.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: List pending\n  type: http\n  seq: 1\n}\n\nget {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/{{test_app_id}}/approvals\n  body: none\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\ndocs {\n  Tool calls awaiting user approval (apps with `default_policy: approval` or actions with `require_approval: true`). Each entry: request_id, tool_name, params, risk_level, submitted_at.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 383, "lines": 20, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.1161785, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 19, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4862616}, "bruno/digitorn-api/09 - Approvals/Resolve approval.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: Resolve approval\n  type: http\n  seq: 2\n}\n\npost {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/{{test_app_id}}/approve\n  body: json\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\nbody:json {\n  {\n    \"request_id\": \"req_abc123\",\n    \"approved\": true,\n    \"message\": \"OK\"\n  }\n}\n\ndocs {\n  Approve or deny a pending approval request. `request_id` comes from /approvals list. `approved: false` denies (the tool returns an error to the agent). The optional `message` (aliases: `response`, `answer`, `value`, `reply`) lets the user attach a note — useful for ask_user responses.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 585, "lines": 28, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.1199095, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 27, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4862616}, "bruno/digitorn-api/10-lagout/folder.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: 10-lagout\n  seq: 13\n}\n\nauth {\n  mode: inherit\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 63, "lines": 9, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.1240308, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 8, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4862616}, "bruno/digitorn-api/10-lagout/Logout.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: Logout\n  type: http\n  seq: 1\n}\n\npost {\n  url: {{base_url}}/auth/logout\n  body: json\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\nbody:json {\n  {\n    \"refresh_token\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n  }\n}\n\nscript:post-response {\n  if (res.status === 200) {\n    bru.setEnvVar(\"access_token\", \"\");\n    bru.setEnvVar(\"refresh_token\", \"\");\n  }\n}\n\ndocs {\n  Revokes both the access token (read from the Authorization header) and the refresh token (from the body). Env vars are cleared on success.\n  \n  If you get \"Invalid character in header content\", it's a client-side issue — your stored access_token likely has a trailing newline. See Fix: strip the token before setting Bruno env var.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 704, "lines": 35, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.1240308, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 34, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4862616}, "bruno/digitorn-api/99 - Cleanup/folder.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: 99 - Cleanup\n  seq: 14\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 40, "lines": 5, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.1355793, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 4, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4930832}, "bruno/digitorn-api/99 - Cleanup/Undeploy app.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: Undeploy app\n  type: http\n  seq: 1\n}\n\ndelete {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/apps/{{test_app_id}}\n  body: none\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\ndocs {\n  Stops the app, releases modules, tears down sessions. The DB row + bundle remain on disk — call POST /api/apps/deploy with the same YAML to redeploy. Use DELETE /api/apps/{id}?purge=true to also wipe the DB row.\n\n  **If you get 401 Unauthorized**: your access_token probably expired (default TTL: 900s = 15 min). Re-run `01 - Auth → Refresh` to get a new one — or just re-run Login.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 575, "lines": 22, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.1355793, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 21, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.49232}, "bruno/digitorn-api/environments/Local.bru": {"content": "vars {\n  base_url: http://127.0.0.1:8000\n  email: admin@digitorn.local\n  username: admin\n  password: changeme-12345\n  test_app_id: tutorial-hello-world\n  workspace_app_id: tutorial-workspace-demo\n  workspace_session_id:\n  access_token:\n  refresh_token:\n  user_id:\n  session_id:\n}\nvars:secret [\n  password\n]\n", "language": "text", "size": 307, "lines": 17, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.1355793, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 16, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.4930832}, "bruno/digitorn-api-full/bruno.json": {"content": "{\n  \"version\": \"1\",\n  \"name\": \"Digitorn API \\u2014 full\",\n  \"type\": \"collection\",\n  \"ignore\": [\n    \"node_modules\",\n    \".git\"\n  ]\n}\n", "language": "json", "size": 133, "lines": 10, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.1355793, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 9, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.2752144}, "bruno/digitorn-api-full/join_session.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: join_session\n  type: ws\n  seq: 18\n}\n\nws {\n  url: http://127.0.0.1:8000\n  body: ws\n  auth: inherit\n}\n\nbody:ws {\n  name: message 1\n  type: json\n  content: '''\n    {\n      \n    }\n  '''\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 199, "lines": 22, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.15198, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 21, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.3341155}, "bruno/digitorn-api-full/README.md": {"content": "# Digitorn API - full collection\n\n260 requests auto-generated from `app.openapi()`. Regenerate with:\n```\npy -3.12 tools/export_openapi.py && py -3.12 tools/export_bruno.py\n```\n\n## Run order (lower seq = earlier)\n\nFolders are prioritised so tokens + app_id + session_id are captured before anything that depends on them:\n\n| seq | folder | notes |\n|-----|--------|-------|\n| 10  | auth   | login first → captures access_token, refresh_token, user_id |\n| 20  | user   |       |\n| 30  | discovery | read-only |\n| 40  | modules   | read-only |\n| 50  | credentials | configure API keys |\n| 60  | mcp   |       |\n| 70  | packages |    |\n| 80  | apps  | deploy → create_session → send_message (captures app_id, session_id) |\n| 90  | builder |     |\n| 100+ | oauth, config, ui, transcribe, requires, untagged | |\n| 900 | security | grants/revokes - near the end |\n| 910 | admin  | destructive - run last |\n\n## State-driven 404s on first Run all\n\n`auth/session_history`, `auth/fork_session`, `auth/delete_session` all read from the `UserSession` table which is **populated lazily** (persistence.py:57): the row only gets written when a conversation session persists its first message. On a clean daemon:\n\n  1. Auth runs at seq 10 - UserSession table empty → **404**\n  2. Apps runs at seq 80 - session_send_message populates a row\n  3. Second Run all - the 404s disappear\n\nSame logic applies to routes that need a `{{request_id}}` (approval resolve), `{{credential_id}}`, `{{draft_id}}`, `{{task_id}}`, `{{mcp_server_id}}` - those IDs don't exist in a fresh database. Create the resource manually with its POST route first, then the GET/DELETE/PUT variants succeed.\n\n## Variables filled automatically\n\n| Variable | Captured by |\n|----------|-------------|\n| `access_token`, `refresh_token`, `user_id` | `auth/login` and `auth/register` |\n| `access_token`, `refresh_token` | `auth/refresh` |\n| `app_id` | `apps/deploy_app` |\n| `session_id` | `apps/create_session` |\n| `last_correlation_id` | `apps/session_send_message` |\n\n## Variables you fill in `environments/Local.bru`\n\n- `email`, `username`, `password` - your real credentials\n- `yaml_path` - absolute path to the YAML you want to deploy\n- `message` - text sent to the agent\n\n", "language": "markdown", "size": 2219, "lines": 53, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.1558375, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 52, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777378984.5551465}, "bruno/digitorn-api-full/admin/DELETE api admin quotas -quota_id.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: admin_delete_quota\n  type: http\n  seq: 3\n}\n\ndelete {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/admin/quotas/{{quota_id}}\n  body: none\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\n", "language": "text", "size": 192, "lines": 17, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.1558375, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 16, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.0934024}, "bruno/digitorn-api-full/admin/folder.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: admin\n  seq: 910\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 34, "lines": 5, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.1681862, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 4, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.0934024}, "bruno/digitorn-api-full/admin/GET api admin quotas.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: admin_list_quotas\n  type: http\n  seq: 1\n}\n\nget {\n  url: {{base_url}}/api/admin/quotas\n  body: none\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\nparams:query {\n  scope_type: \n  scope_id: \n  app_id: \n}\n\n", "language": "text", "size": 232, "lines": 23, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.170195, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 22, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 1777240761.0934024}, "bruno/digitorn-api-full/admin/logout.bru": {"content": "meta {\n  name: logout\n  type: http\n  seq: 4\n}\n\npost {\n  url: {{base_url}}/auth/logout\n  body: json\n  auth: bearer\n}\n\nauth:bearer {\n  token: {{access_token}}\n}\n\nbody:json {\n  {}\n}\n\ndocs {\n  Revoke the caller's session.\n  \n  Accepts an empty body. The access token is taken from the\n  ``Authorization: Bearer`` header (the same place the middleware\n  found it to let the request through), so logout is a single call\n  from the client with no payload required.\n}\n", "language": "text", "size": 460, "lines": 29, "operation": "disk_sync", "updated_at": 1778628122.1757836, "validation": "approved", "baseline_lines": 28, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0, "total_insertions": 0, "total_deletions": 0, "insertions_pending": 0, "deletions_pending": 0, "unified_diff_pending": "", "disk_mtime": 177