Time to search for new jobs matching your CV\\\",\\\"dispa\",\n    \"evidence\": {},\n    \"timestamp\": 1776670436.5867646\n  },\n  \"BUG-055\": {\n    \"verdict\": \"NOT_FIXED\",\n    \"detail\": \"status 404\",\n    \"evidence\": {},\n    \"timestamp\": 1776670436.5867646\n  },\n  \"BUG-056\": {\n    \"verdict\": \"FIXED\",\n    \"detail\": \"list_providers action present (11 total)\",\n    \"evidence\": {},\n    \"timestamp\": 1776670436.5867646\n  },\n  \"BUG-065\": {\n    \"verdict\": \"FIXED\",\n    \"detail\": \"approve returns 400\",\n    \"evidence\": {},\n    \"timestamp\": 1776670436.5867646\n  },\n  \"BUG-066\": {\n    \"verdict\": \"FIXED\",\n    \"detail\": \"both /workspace and /export return 200\",\n    \"evidence\": {},\n    \"timestamp\": 1776670436.5867646\n  },\n  \"BUG-067\": {\n    \"verdict\": \"FIXED\",\n    \"detail\": \"standard envelope: ['success', 'data']\",\n    \"evidence\": {},\n    \"timestamp\": 1776670436.5867646\n  },\n  \"BUG-069\": {\n    \"verdict\": \"NOT_FIXED\",\n    \"detail\": \"ACA-Credentials='true' without ACAO (noise)\",\n    \"evidence\": {},\n    \"timestamp\": 1776670436.5867646\n  },\n  \"BUG-079\": {\n    \"verdict\": \"FIXED\",\n    \"detail\": \"asset access 403\",\n    \"evidence\": {},\n    \"timestamp\": 1776670436.5867646\n  },\n  \"BUG-082\": {\n    \"verdict\": \"SKIP\",\n    \"detail\": \"connect params schema: [{'name': 'connection_id', 'type': 'string', 'required': True, 'default': None, 'description': \\\"Unique name for this connection (e.g. 'main', 'analytics', 'crm'). Used to reference the connection in all subsequent actions.\\\", 'enum': None}, {'name': 'driver', 'type': 'string', 'required': True, 'default': None, 'description': \\\"Database driver: 'sqlite', 'postgresql', 'mysql', 'mssql', 'oracle', 'mongodb', 'redis'. Alias: ``type``.\\\", 'enum': None}, {'name': 'database', 'type': 'string', 'required': False, 'default': None, 'description': \\\"Database name or file path. Required for all dr